{"id":"n63482-1-11","stage":5,"title":"소모 · 消耗","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63482-1-11-1","ko":"다이어트에 좋은 운동에는 뭐가 있을까?","zh":"有哪些对减肥有益的运动呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다이어트에","meaning":"节食，减肥","explanation":"다이어트：节食，减肥；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"다이어트","audio":"/audio/5998c9b179df5fd3b4c0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28352","senseId":"1","lemma":"다이어트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다이어트에","audio":"/audio/71d170d8222da14adb38.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，有益，有效","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"운동에는","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동에는","audio":"/audio/279567b5c408e30ed164.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐가","audio":"/audio/2c57e944c5dd1dbd2cf3.mp3"}},{"text":"있을까?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을까","audio":"/audio/263e0eb545ea59d74b53.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5998c9b179df5fd3","term":"다이어트","zh":"节食，减肥","audio":"/audio/5998c9b179df5fd3b4c0.mp3","entryId":"28352","defini